// Moves for B01, the Hollow Sentry (registry 9100-9199). Source:
// docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "B01 Hollow Sentry" (overhead slam with a 30-tick
// wind-up, a horizontal sweep, a shield bash with a 14-tick wind-up, and a 3-hit combo that
// ends in a 40-tick punish window). Damage comes from the body's `attack`, so
// `motion_value` is the only multiplier. Every attack telegraphs for at least 12 frames and
// every combo ends in at least 20 frames of recovery (checked by `lf_content::boss::check`).
// Hit and frame numbers are tuning. The lantern flare vfx marks the wind-up.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
[
  (
